    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορμύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, of water, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roar and boil</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμὸν] ἀφρῷ μορμύροντα ἰδών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.599
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.325
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόος Ὠκεανοῖο ἀφρῷ μορμύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.403
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.543
			</span></i>, etc.: in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.26
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, =
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				82
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμῷ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					5.118
				</span></i>
			. (Onomatopoeic word.)</div>
